. <source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source> <volume>97</volume>:<fpage>2697</fpage>&#x02013;2702.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10706628</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib20"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal">Said, J.W., M.R. Rettig, K. Heppner, R.A. Vescio, G. Schiller, H.J. Ma, D. Belson, A. Savage, I.P. Shintaku, H.P. Koeffler, et al. <year>1997</year>. Localization of Kaposi's sarcoma-associated herpesvirus in bone marrow biopsy samples from patients with multiple myeloma. <source>Blood.</source> <volume>90</volume>:<fpage>4278</fpage>&#x02013;4282.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9373238</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal">Staudt, L.M., and S. Dave. <year>2005</year>. The biology of human lymphoid malignancies revealed by gene expression profiling. <source>Adv. Immunol.</source> <volume>87</volume>:<fpage>163</fpage>&#x02013;208.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16102574</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal">Coukos, G., F. Benencia, R.J. Buckanovich, and J.R. Conejo-Garcia. <year>2005</year>. The role of dendritic cell precursors in tumour vasculogenesis. <source>Br. J. Cancer.</source> <volume>92</volume>:<fpage>1182</fpage>&#x02013;1187.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15785750</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal">Ehrlich, L.A., and G.D. Roodman. <year>2005</year>. The role of immune cells and inflammatory cytokines in Paget's disease and multiple myeloma. <source>Immunol. Rev.</source> <volume>208</volume>:<fpage>252</fpage>&#x02013;266.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16313353</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="journal">Yaccoby, S., M.J. Wezeman, A. Henderson, M. Cottler-Fox, Q. Yi, B. Barlogie, and J. Epstein. <year>2004</year>. Cancer and the microenvironment: myeloma-osteoclast interactions as a model. <source>Cancer Res.</source> <volume>64</volume>: